<title>UK: SAS Cargo appoints new worldwide general manager.</title>
<headline>SAS Cargo appoints new worldwide general manager.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scandinavian Airlines System has appointed Peter Gronlund as vice-president and general manager for SAS Cargo worldwide.</p>
<p>Gronlund joined SAS in 1976, holding a number of positions in SAS' Danish operations, and takes over from Einar Longva, who has held the post for the past five years, the airline said in a statement. - Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
